# GitHub Linguist Language Detection Overrides
# Mark benchmark scripts and vendor C/C++/Python files as vendored/documentation
# so GitHub correctly reports Cynapse as a 100% Pure Rust repository.

engine/leafcutter_core/rust/llama.cpp/* linguist-vendored
engine/leafcutter_core/scripts/* linguist-vendored
*.py linguist-vendored
*.cpp linguist-vendored
*.c linguist-vendored
*.h linguist-vendored
*.cu linguist-vendored
*.sh linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-vendored
